# Xiaomi / HyperOS Privacy Hosts
# Blocks known anti-fraud, package scanning, app-list backup,
# telemetry, analytics and Xiaomi advertising endpoints.
# Does not block Xiaomi Push, account, OTA or core Mi Cloud services.

